      "writtenOn": "2023-06-06T15:24:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why the range is not 0x1_0000 - 0x400_0000 (AARCH64_MMIO_BASE + AARCH64_MMIO_SIZE) [1]?\n\n[1] https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/crosvm/aarch64/src/lib.rs;l\u003d202;drc\u003d4a70373f29bd06cc6ca46ee6823f370e6a906496",
